{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1c8701fb73fd9d6945949b2273e10d2adb311c9d693e3258316d735e9c483b4c","ja":"悪い子になっちゃいます！","zh":"要变成坏孩子了！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"92cefcdf74a1118c5fa7b2755b98898dc22d3d8299d9929d0a9fdf6e4ff64017","ja":"ええっ！？　さっき話してたのって、\n自分達が出るバラエティ番組のことだったの！？","zh":"诶诶！？刚才说的，\n原来是指我们自己要上的综艺节目吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6b19a718a5dda93f7d41aad5491e2b77845d10cf09994d38bfb2872077fc2d81","ja":"この前、『いい子』がテーマでお仕事したから、\n今度は逆のことをしよう、って企画なんだ？","zh":"上次的工作主题是“好孩子”，\n所以这次的企划是想反其道而行之吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2d2c7750e63b32fa85c7507c5938b29fd3e12f528b7809408a6ac6ce1af47324","ja":"それで、悪い子になるアイデアを考えてたのね。","zh":"所以，你才在想怎么当个坏孩子啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"31f369b7abea44f1610064b72423136b4b589b1c2fbc2cebf4c5045de603c8d1","ja":"響もやよいも、慌て者なんだから。\n……まあ、私もちょっとは焦っちゃったけど。","zh":"响和弥生真是两个毛躁鬼。\n……不过，我也稍微有些着急就是了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3ff098e6eaca608087e31c645740cc3a887a48b25efe9e32c86d81abe33ded35","ja":"本番は、劇場にかくしカメラをいっぱい置いて\n撮影するんだよ。","zh":"正式演出时，会在剧场里放置很多隐藏摄像头\n来进行拍摄哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c83c15525f73a65cb870374648269b3e7cec122b12ac9152dee5fa3f660db382","ja":"みんなには、「いつもの劇場の様子を\n撮影する企画」って説明するんだって。","zh":"跟其他人说是“拍摄剧场平时\n模样的企划”哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"da6f610203f650af4e3376744057c92b213c4e7fc28afddcb92c12ef5cf2a8f0","ja":"おやぶんにも、秘密なんだって。\nみんなをびっくりさせようね！","zh":"听说要对老大保密呢。\n我们要让大家吓一跳哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5416761475bd2748e16c3c9ed4e3862fecc109963290a8408bae1129d9fed1b0","ja":"それじゃあ、響さんたちも集まったし、\n改めて、どんなことをするか考えよ。","zh":"那么，响她们也到齐了，\n重新想想该做些什么吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"5909c1f0d5fe7402f692114623055e7088e1b422dd23bd4f33c3059edc684b82","ja":"たまき、すっごく悪いことするぞ～。\nくふふ♪","zh":"环要干一件超级大坏事哦～。\n嘿嘿♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"a768f8f5127dea08695fb3b5158df554c34282f2cd2c4c591b6c4473141d6a3a","ja":"6人で話し合ってから数日後。\nバラエティ番組の収録当日……","zh":"6人商量过后的数日后。\n综艺节目录制当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"b06d7a0a53cd0e588bd114b259a771f459e54840a7ff205353a0d92a2b2ea5b6","ja":"「それじゃあ、私達は隠しカメラの映像を\n見ていますから。ご自由にどうぞ」","zh":"「那我们去看着隐藏摄像机的画面了。\n请自便吧」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"e2b5a02b41f9d5afedf12e014df76c228712b5182b95e3cce14a41891032fa2b","ja":"はーい！　よろしくお願いしまーす！","zh":"好——！请多指教啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"40f7a8078a654c7b44e99174d1e2a7e8b599a48997ff4f86b646016cf50affc3","ja":"それじゃあ、これをこうして……えへへ。こんなに\nちらかしちゃうなんて、すっごく悪い子だよねっ。","zh":"那么，把这个这样弄……诶嘿嘿。弄得这么\n乱七八糟的，简直是个超级坏孩子呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"ffbf57d10886368db26f0e49c4f34580ae9fa882b32b577a3bac10cdeb47b71b","ja":"机の上が、物でいーっぱいになっちゃったね！\nえーっと……。","zh":"桌子上变得全～都是东西了呢！\n那个……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"c53101a0262b0c0f158038dd573a804a6d1a31bd0d9d6972bc42127dc4ecaf7c","ja":"えっ、やよいさん！？\nどうしてお片付けしてるの！？","zh":"诶，弥生！？\n为什么在收拾东西啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"0c73c0c5297ad1cbea23cf845e3bd90420b1f71b7aeb646c985df0d5eb9ff067","ja":"あっ！？　ご、ごめんね、つい……\n家でも、ぱぱぱーってお掃除したりするからかな～？","zh":"啊！？对、对不起，一时不小心……\n大概是因为在家里也总是噼里啪啦地打扫吧～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"ff62f7139a2350b47c192e8930b52afc15705c29a56033a14388fd5fce9da240","ja":"そっか～……うう。わたしも、落ち着かないかも。\n悪いことしたから、もういいよね。片付けちゃおう。","zh":"这样啊～……呜呜。我也觉得定不下心来。\n既然做了坏事，那这样就行了吧。把它收拾掉吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"deef5f261d3934e82de013d5ff60b9fc435e61914882c9f292474d9b6b83d126","ja":"たまきは、夜ごはんをたべられなくなっちゃうくらい、\nお菓子をい～っぱい食べるんだ♪","zh":"环要吃超～级多的点心，\n多到晚饭都吃不下的程度♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"12ec0a063bc9ad2203b8b60fda4bfe7b8fda26dce802f2f5371bd60229f1edb3","ja":"……あっ！　でも今日はハンバーグだった。\nたまき、ハンバーグ食べたいぞ～……。","zh":"……啊！可是今天吃的是汉堡肉。\n环想吃汉堡肉啦～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"003cfd2fa7c02438fd52581c7e563eaf7c64df28c752aee3a483c3a27fb61861","ja":"えっ、じゃあ自分だけでも……あっ！　今日中に\n食べないといけないゴーヤがあったんだった！","zh":"诶，那我一个人去也……啊！想起来今天之内\n必须把苦瓜吃掉了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1751.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"af8c283fbc02bafc0dde246ab965e9afb5782dfd69a691f8ad53877f2f80ab5f","ja":"うう……お菓子をいっぱい食べたいけど、\n食べ過ぎないようにしないと……。","zh":"呜呜……虽然想吃好多点心，\n但必须克制不能吃太多……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
